{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:102883","published":"2026-11-24T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-25T15:30:14.640330308Z","related":["CVE-2026-110264","CVE-2026-132825","CVE-2026-93577","CVE-2026-97229"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-110264","CVE-2026-132825","CVE-2026-93577","CVE-2026-97229"],"summary":"Critical: ruby:4.0 security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"Ruby is an extensible, interpreted, object-oriented, scripting language. It has features to process text files and to perform system management tasks.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * ruby: integer overflow issue in regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-93577)\n  * ruby: integer overflow issue in CI/CD regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-97229)\n  * ruby: integer overflow issue in regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-110264)\n  * ruby: ruby: Heap-based buffer overflow via string case conversion (CVE-2026-132825)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * ruby:4.0/ruby: Rebase to the latest Ruby 4.0 release [rhel-9.9.z] (JIRA:RHEL-312600)\n  * ruby:4.0/ruby: Rebase to the latest Ruby 4.0 release [rhel-9.9.z] (JIRA:RHEL-313265)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"ruby","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/ruby"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.0.10-37.module_el9.9.0+370+8bfec1f7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:102883.json"}},{"package":{"name":"ruby-bundled-gems","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/ruby-bundled-gems"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.0.10-37.module_el9.9.0+370+8bfec1f7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:102